if $ARGS[0] = 'car':
	*clr & cla
	'"Think why you are here." - he said'
	'He closed the trunk and the car moves somewhere…'
	!! choose the event result

	temp = rand(1,100) - phroberkilled * 20

	!! if temp <= 20:
		!-=wip=-
		!yacht
		!бомжі

	if temp <= 30:
		!! sauna
		wait 1000
		minut += rand(40,240)
		money = 0
		gs 'stat'
		workDolg += rand(20,40)*1000
		*nl
		'I am at the sauna. The brutes drag me into a room and start to explain. "You''re going to live here and work until you have cleared your debt. Got it? Try to contact the authorities or escape, we''ll put a bullet in your head and bury you in the woods, understand?"'
		'I become frightened as they''re convincing, so I just nod.'
		act 'Look around': gt 'city_sauna', 'saunaroom'
	elseif temp <= 100:
		!! carwork
		wait 1000
		minut += rand(40,240)
		money = 0
		gs 'stat'
		'You don''t have to be a genius to understand: he will rape me further, and maybe others will. I can''t do anything right now, or can I? ..'
		*nl
		'……Ai! My thoughts were interrupted by the feeling of a stab in the arm'
		mood -= 30
		'<center><img <<$set_imgh>> src="mod/public_WC/wc/events/90/5carsoldevent/wait.jpg"></center>'
		gs 'drugs', 'aphrodisiac'
		gs 'drugs', 'heroin'
		mc_inventory['amphetamine'] += 1
		mc_inventory['aphrodisiac'] += 1
		gs 'stat'
		act 'Continue':
			*clr & cla
			'Listen to me, Whore, now you have a little work to do, nothing new for you. If you obey everything will end well.'
			act 'Nod to Yes':
				willpowermax -= rand(1,2)
